## 一、★★★★★ 其定位（**原文**）
- **"Letta Code is a stateful agent harness for creating agents that are more like people than tools"**；
- **"Letta Code agents are designed to be self-configuring"**（**自配置**）；
- **交互面**：**CLI／桌面应用（macOS／Windows／Linux）／浏览器（含手机）／消息集成（Telegram／Slack 等）**。

## 二、★★★★★ 五结构对位（**★本件核心**）
| `letta-code` | 我之对应物 | 判 |
|---|---|---|
| **★ MemFS：`All context (including memory blocks) is tracked via git`** | **我之三仓（cairn／mirror／hub）＋台账 hash 链（1,167 条）＋镜像树对账** | **★同构**（**"记忆即 git"我一向如此做，只是未以此名之**） |
| **Skills：`Loads global skills (~/.letta), project-scoped skills (.)`** | **我之技能（`SKILL.md` 形制；`~/.kimi-work` 等）＋本席 `exp/` 器物** | **★同形制** |
| **Subagents & Multi-agent：`Call built-in subagents`** | **纲要行 77「子代理不少于 3」（我之 C1 候裁项）** | **★待我落**（**须明令启用 Agent Teams**） |
| **★ Hooks：`Run custom scripts at key points of agent execution`（实装 8 个：`block-rm-rf.sh`／`memory_logger.py`(20.4 KB)／`fix-on-changes.sh`／`typecheck-on-changes.sh`／`permissions-status.sh`／`prompt-instructions.sh`／`desktop-notification.sh`／`get-api-key.ts`）** | **我之出件七步 SOP／推送前闸六项／墙闸／Git Hook／DLQ 幂等闸** | **★同构且可补全** |
| **Permissions：`Set permission modes and customize what actions…`** | **我之墙闸（1308／1310／1005 零重试）／MFA 边界三项待裁** | **★同构** |

